  "vibe": "Amber sky (#ef9d4f) over dark-earth ink (#3a2417) and cream (#fbeed8), with a yellow sun (#f6d35c) that is not decoration — it climbs 140px through every beat, tied to scene progress rather than the clock, so the light literally rises while you read. Staatliches stamps the titles; Assistant carries the body. Behind them three cloud ellipses drift at separate speeds, a sienna hill band rolls across, two flat-top acacias anchor left and right at different scales, and three filled animal silhouettes gallop the plain on hopping legs while a huge ink ellipse closes the foreground like a viewing hide. The frame rolls a full 1.2° and spins on one beat. Feature panels drop the world and sit on burnt sienna. For safari lodges, expedition travel, outdoor gear and nature-documentary storytelling.",
